---
description: Cryptex verification and testing discipline
alwaysApply: false
---

Testing requirements:
- A feature is not complete because it compiles.
- Run the tests and checks required by the current milestone and Definition of Done.
- Do not weaken or delete a failing test merely to make CI green.
- Verify cross-platform behavior where required.
- Include failure, corruption, recovery and security cases when the milestone requires them.
- Doctor and recovery verification are product requirements, not optional tooling.
- Report exactly what was executed, what passed, what failed and what was not verified.
